{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Iron Houndmaster","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/iron-houndmaster.webp","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/iron-houndmaster.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Iron Houndmaster","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":132,"temp":0,"max":132,"details":""},"ac":{"value":27,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":8},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>When a construct workshop ceased production of hound and guard type constructs and scrapped the remaining models, a rogue construct crafter found the scrap and tried to make them work again. The result was a batch of iron houndmasters, mismatched mechanical patrol units that excelled at locating and capturing any trespasser foolish enough to enter their patrol field.</p>\n<h2>Separation Anxiety</h2>\n<p>Allowing an iron houndmaster to separate is a risky proposition because the halves may not combine back together correctly. When multiple houndmasters are on the field, the closest halves attempt to rewire themselves together at the end of combat. The result may be two masters or two hounds fused together, with a resulting duplication in their abilities.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 64/140/250 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing), armor (heavy), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Stealth, Survival)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, dexterity, electricity, energy resistant (negative, positive), strength, throwing, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Kitsune Kirin","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":6},"cha":{"mod":-5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":20,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":13,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":19,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":18},"athletics":{"base":16},"stealth":{"base":16},"survival":{"base":18}},"traits":{"value":["construct","mindless"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"med"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/iron-houndmaster.webp","items":[{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Split Anatomy","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The iron houndmaster's two halves are not fully wired to function in unison. When the iron houndmaster rolls initiative, its hound half uses its normal initiative roll and its master half uses the result of its initiative roll –5. Neither half can Delay. Instead of getting three actions and one reaction as normal, each half of the iron houndmaster gains two actions and one reaction on its respective turn. The halves calculate their multiple attack bonus separately. Only the master can use the metal fist and shock stick Strikes, and only the hound can use the metallic fangs and dart gun Strikes.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"houndmaster-form","suboptions":[{"label":"Combined","value":"combined"},{"label":"Hound","value":"hound"},{"label":"Master","value":"master"}],"toggleable":true,"alwaysActive":true,"label":"Current Form","value":true,"selection":"combined"},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"bludgeoning","dice":2,"die":"d8","modifier":8}},"attackModifier":18,"key":"Strike","slug":"metal-fist","label":"Metal Fist","traits":["agile","finesse"],"predicate":[{"not":"houndmaster-form:hound"}]},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"bludgeoning","dice":2,"die":"d6","modifier":8}},"attackModifier":18,"key":"Strike","slug":"shock-stick","label":" Shock Stick","traits":["electricity","finesse"],"predicate":[{"not":"houndmaster-form:master"}]},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"piercing","dice":2,"die":"d8","modifier":8}},"attackModifier":18,"key":"Strike","slug":"metallic-fangs","label":"Metallic Fangs","traits":["agile","finesse"],"predicate":[{"or":["houndmaster-form:combined","houndmaster-form:hound"]}]},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"piercing","dice":2,"die":"d6","modifier":8}},"attackModifier":18,"key":"Strike","slug":"dart-gun","label":"Dart Gun","range":{"increment":60},"traits":["reload-0"],"predicate":[{"not":"houndmaster-form:master"}]},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"shock-stick-damage","diceNumber":1,"dieSize":"d12","damageType":"electricity","label":"Shock Stick"}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"MyGNCsdOIXFSZiPv","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688753107429,"modifiedTime":1691717804195,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Release the Hound","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When the iron houndmaster is reduced to 60 or fewer Hit Points, its two halves separate. Its remaining Hit Points are split between the hound and the master, rounding up. While separated, the two halves gain 3 actions and a reaction on each of their turns, the hound's Speed increases to 50 feet, and both halves have their AC reduced to 24.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":-3,"predicate":[{"not":"houndmaster-form:combined"}]},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"land-speed","value":20,"predicate":["houndmaster-form:hound"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"TW0YM0bzx4UkcP7K","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688753150120,"modifiedTime":1691717405951,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Bring Down","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Only the hound half can use this action</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The hound performs a metallic fangs Strike. On a hit, it also knocks the target @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Prone]{Prone}, and on a critical hit, the target takes an additional [[/r 1d8[persistent,bleed]]] damage.</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","option":"bring-down","toggleable":true,"value":false,"predicate":[{"not":"houndmaster-form:master"}]},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"metallic-fangs-damage","dieSize":"d8","diceNumber":1,"damageType":"bleed","predicate":["bring-down"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"hFr1uB4n5C8Bynhd","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688753978770,"modifiedTime":1691717669299,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Net Cannon","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Only the hound half can use this action</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The hound half launches a net at a target within 60 feet. The target attempts a @Check[type:reflex|dc:26] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Off-Guard]{Off-Guard} until the end of the hound's next turn, though it can use an Interact action to end the effect early.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is caught in the net. It is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Immobilized]{Immobilized} and off-guard until it Escapes, with an @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Escape]{Escape} DC of 26.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature is also knocked @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Prone]{Prone}. The iron houndmaster can't use Net Cannon again for [[/br 1d4 #Net Cannon Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"iPihVCNjES6TLFJN","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688753979655,"modifiedTime":1688754120548,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Subduing Strike","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Only the master half can use this action</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The master makes a melee Strike. On a hit, the target takes the normal damage from the Strike and attempts a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:23] save; this additional effect has the incapacitation trait.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stunned]{Stunned 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stunned]{Stunned 4}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Z1a9WJ0YKzZ0W0TP","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688753980622,"modifiedTime":1691717454901,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542896571,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"YQuKu1xTj4eKpWVN","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":3700000}